mmit_id":"2340655e627c6e467af0d384382a2281a8a03ca4","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sivagollapalli/rails/commits/2340655e627c6e467af0d384382a2281a8a03ca4","created_at":"2014-12-29T14:32:30Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/issues/comments/83666189","html_url":"https://github.com/rails/rails/issues/17935#issuecomment-83666189","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/issues/17935","id":83666189,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDgzNjY2MTg5","user":{"login":"jacob-daniel-waller","id":2738064,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MzgwNjQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2738064?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacob-daniel-waller","html_url":"https://github.com/jacob-daniel-waller","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacob-daniel-waller/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacob-daniel-waller/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacob-daniel-waller/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacob-daniel-waller/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacob-daniel-waller/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacob-daniel-waller/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacob-daniel-waller/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacob-daniel-waller/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacob-daniel-waller/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2015-03-19T17:03:53Z","updated_at":"2015-03-19T17:03:53Z","body":"@sgrif - Is it possible that this could still be an issue when it generates the schema.rb? I verified that it now works fine under Rails 4.2 when executed with a schema migration but when it regenerates the schema.rb file it does not translate into a bigint. It does not add the limit: 8 as it did in rails 4.1.\n\nHere is one of the columns\n\nRails 4.1 schema.rb generation after migration runs.\n\n<code>\nt.integer  \"my_bigint_data\", limit: 8,                              array: true\n</code>\n\nRails 4.2 schema.rb generation after migration runs.\n\n<code>\nt.integer  \"my_bigint_data\",                                          array: true\n</code>\n\nWhen I put the limit: 8 back and rebuild off of schema.rb everything works good again.\n\nIf this is not part of the same issue please let me know.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/issues/comments/83666189/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"jacob-daniel-waller","id":2738064,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MzgwNjQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2738064?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacob-daniel-waller","html_url":"https://github.com/jacob-daniel-waller","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacob-daniel-waller/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacob-daniel-waller/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacob-daniel-waller/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacob-daniel-waller/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacob-daniel-waller/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacob-daniel-waller/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacob-daniel-waller/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacob-daniel-waller/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacob-daniel-waller/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":259607217,"node_id":"MDE0Ok1lbnRpb25lZEV2ZW50MjU5NjA3MjE3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/issues/events/259607217","actor":{"login":"sgrif","id"